<http://data.silknow.org/object/e5caad8e-f967-3eda-902b-91c7859b23c3/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Child's crochet cap of white cotton. The back is formed of a circle crocheted with a design of petals or rays surrounding a circle in a mesh ground. The headpiece is made of a straight piece of crochet consisting of a pattern of small diamonds, each with a raised bobble in the centre. The two parts are joined and the whole cap is edged with a band of solid crochet and openwork ending in a double scalloped border. Lined with white silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/e5caad8e-f967-3eda-902b-91c7859b23c3> .

